WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.681 --> 00:00:17.785
"I hope we reach the Western Paradise soon," said the Tang Monk.

2
00:00:19.106 --> 00:00:20.926
"This journey has been very dangerous."

3
00:00:22.787 --> 00:00:28.284
nodded. "Those three demons tried to pickle me!"

4
00:00:28.364 --> 00:00:30.425
Everybody laughed, even Bajie.

5
00:00:30.445 --> 00:00:33.806
"Wukong, what happened to those demons?"

6
00:00:34.186 --> 00:00:35.027
asked Wujing.

7
00:00:36.287 --> 00:00:38.068
took them away," said Wukong.

8
00:00:38.088 --> 00:00:40.149
"I'm sure they were punished."

9
00:00:41.369 --> 00:00:44.190
"Thank you again for saving us," said the Tang Monk.

10
00:00:45.231 --> 00:00:46.631
Wukong waved his hand.

11
00:00:47.292 --> 00:00:48.752
was nothing, Master.

12
00:00:49.533 --> 00:00:50.633
Buddha did most of the work."

13
00:00:54.074 --> 00:00:57.916
The group felt a strong wind blow down from the mountains up ahead.

14
00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:02.341
A dark fog filled the sky and then disappeared.

15
00:01:03.721 --> 00:01:04.962
Tang Monk was nervous.

16
00:01:04.982 --> 00:01:08.063
"Wh-what caused that wind and fog?"

17
00:01:10.223 --> 00:01:12.624
"Relax, Master," said Wukong.

18
00:01:13.924 --> 00:01:16.925
sure it was something harmless—maybe some small demons.

19
00:01:17.806 --> 00:01:18.306
I'll go check."

20
00:01:22.927 --> 00:01:25.588
The monkey walked up the road and around a bend.

21
00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:29.461
He heard laughter and looked up.

22
00:01:30.461 --> 00:01:35.002
High above the road, a fat monster was sitting on the edge of a cliff.

23
00:01:36.083 --> 00:01:38.663
Several little demons sat next to the monster.

24
00:01:39.844 --> 00:01:42.144
Wukong flew up to get a closer look.

25
00:01:43.585 --> 00:01:46.226
The fat monster appeared to be concentrating.

26
00:01:47.126 --> 00:01:48.486
Suddenly "Braap!"

27
00:01:49.907 --> 00:01:53.728
A burp as loud as thunder blew down the mountain.

28
00:01:55.648 --> 00:01:57.430
The demons giggled and laughed.

29
00:01:57.450 --> 00:02:01.433
"That was your best burp yet!"

30
00:02:01.573 --> 00:02:02.494
cried one demon.

31
00:02:03.334 --> 00:02:04.816
monster patted his belly.

32
00:02:04.836 --> 00:02:07.718
"Yes, I'm proud of that one."

33
00:02:08.679 --> 00:02:09.800
"Show us the fog again!"

34
00:02:10.100 --> 00:02:11.000
said another demon.

35
00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:13.643
"Coming right up!"

36
00:02:13.943 --> 00:02:14.784
said the monster.

37
00:02:15.744 --> 00:02:20.668
He covered one nostril with a finger, closed his eyes, and blew hard.

38
00:02:22.470 --> 00:02:25.032
Dark fog poured out of his other nostril.

39
00:02:29.280 --> 00:02:31.001
The demons clapped and cheered.

40
00:02:32.361 --> 00:02:36.602
monster smiled and then "Braap!"

41
00:02:36.622 --> 00:02:38.863
More wind blew down the mountain.

42
00:02:40.443 --> 00:02:41.764
was a roar of laughter.

43
00:02:43.944 --> 00:02:45.905
One demon nearly fell off the cliff.

44
00:02:48.765 --> 00:02:50.046
Wukong shook his head.

45
00:02:50.066 --> 00:02:54.367
"I'm not worried about these demons," he said to himself.

46
00:02:54.387 --> 00:02:57.568
"They're disgusting but not dangerous."

47
00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:01.141
monkey smiled.

48
00:03:01.161 --> 00:03:09.627
"It does give me an idea though Wukong returned to his companions, who were waiting alongside the road.

49
00:03:09.647 --> 00:03:11.789
"Did you see any demons?"

50
00:03:12.149 --> 00:03:12.989
asked Wujing.

51
00:03:14.431 --> 00:03:15.091
shook his head.

52
00:03:15.111 --> 00:03:16.092
"The road is safe."

53
00:03:17.273 --> 00:03:19.254
the monkey pulled Bajie aside.

54
00:03:19.274 --> 00:03:22.556
"Bajie," he whispered.

55
00:03:23.737 --> 00:03:24.558
a village up ahead.

56
00:03:25.078 --> 00:03:28.480
The people there are preparing a huge feast.

57
00:03:28.540 --> 00:03:33.304
I saw vegetables, noodles, tofu, steamed buns, and all sorts of delicious food.

58
00:03:34.485 --> 00:03:37.427
I thought maybe you'd like to go before us and start eating."

59
00:03:38.949 --> 00:03:39.729
licked his lips.

60
00:03:39.749 --> 00:03:41.871
"Thank you for thinking of me, Wukong.

61
00:03:43.172 --> 00:03:44.573
am rather hungry right now."

62
00:03:45.654 --> 00:03:47.456
The pig turned to the Tang Monk.

63
00:03:49.437 --> 00:03:52.580
"Master, I think I should go ahead and check the mountain too.

64
00:03:54.061 --> 00:03:55.582
I trust Wukong, of course.

65
00:03:56.543 --> 00:03:59.845
But we must protect you, and I'd like to be extra safe."

66
00:04:01.085 --> 00:04:02.426
The Tang Monk smiled.

67
00:04:03.046 --> 00:04:03.906
impressed, Bajie.

68
00:04:04.647 --> 00:04:06.007
Thank you for doing extra work."

69
00:04:07.128 --> 00:04:10.049
Bajie winked at Wukong and then headed up the road.

70
00:04:10.069 --> 00:04:16.731
"Braap!" The monster burped again, and another wind blew.

71
00:04:18.652 --> 00:04:21.013
Then he blew more fog from one nostril.

72
00:04:25.935 --> 00:04:27.716
The demons laughed hysterically.

73
00:04:30.509 --> 00:04:34.851
Suddenly there was a loud rumbling sound, and everyone was silent.

74
00:04:35.892 --> 00:04:37.693
monster patted his big belly.

75
00:04:37.713 --> 00:04:40.475
"I'm hungry."

76
00:04:41.715 --> 00:04:43.216
The demons looked at one another.

77
00:04:43.236 --> 00:04:46.058
"I'm hungry too," said one.

78
00:04:46.078 --> 00:04:50.000
"It's probably time for lunch," said another.

79
00:04:51.101 --> 00:04:52.201
The monster stood up.

80
00:04:52.221 --> 00:04:56.404
"Let's go down to the road and find some people to eat!"

81
00:04:57.408 --> 00:05:00.650
The demons cheered and followed the monster down the mountain.

82
00:05:03.051 --> 00:05:06.792
When they got to the road, they made themselves look like people.

83
00:05:07.913 --> 00:05:09.033
The monster chuckled.

84
00:05:09.073 --> 00:05:15.936
"The next time someone comes along this road, it's lunchtime!"

85
00:05:17.277 --> 00:05:18.918
a few moments, they waited.

86
00:05:20.979 --> 00:05:25.225
Then a large pig came around the bend.

87
00:05:25.966 --> 00:05:27.770
said Bajie, smiling.

88
00:05:27.790 --> 00:05:29.293
"I'm here for the
